GnOKzn&_nc_oc=AdqkbhNdscj4it5dLKktiB2EncFPx03NyAn-ad4BHjo0jKypvtoqGf7dly5vLfvMaDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSNhDx4sE8cOMfCu_cLB6hnNi6uPSRb9MYCt8eG_GCYRg&oe=6B08520B"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "134778495298719", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982471_134778498632052_411711373724603695_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VGUqmoTJHBgQ7kNvwFsO9qf&_nc_oc=AdpFMKSF2nXPdvgfoO2qGm2IuHdybt1vIy63OtFTr24mBN_x5YN2KJcap5a8clsYg0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKPl1IqTabY8FIv8fFHVSfbTnZKfidj5qcKputTtI0ow&oe=6B0860E4"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "798605747754490", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982483_798605754421156_1986649763789961237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HBJGE30S8QMQ7kNvwHqPXG0&_nc_oc=AdpOoPY0JxVouxQ6sg54DVY3lAGEspFLxglsw0z2553_uHB8UvSUFpLDE-oEpegUD6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRdsQNEfyMz8oEz0Yo5Z0aZTmkBcIrla5LEjRD62-eBjA&oe=6B084265"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "263294812157372", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035358_263294815490705_4150129998500296228_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QQbqb-MJDPQQ7kNvwHW6iEj&_nc_oc=AdqKyDnzuE0vcqmO6AiMPSihHv-ui4JB_YrtqzUVyqjIB0S2aHFkqacpAhtAauUHx6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRDI7S7ZAWaxq663cQtKYRUyFTKStOi9Fdo2sy60Qw3uQ&oe=6B085527"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Modulia Quest - screenshot.png", "id": "522084335580003", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982449_522084338913336_7694930828877611739_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xf1ElW0x3xcQ7kNvwFDPxw7&_nc_oc=AdpPIwmA-0p2wSN-frTzuadZOZgqKrGfitaF7tSDYEiwnrzQ9R4d-_19nDm2EvHSYpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTawpAgw7aFbeWb5g6193F1PJe4jmzVlwhuVUaEarrNBg&oe=6B084611"}, "display_name": "Modulia Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt allows you to wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has an especially deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your custom studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session (controls the session view of Live\u2122)\n- Circular Keyboard (a beautiful 360\u00b0 keyboard)\n- Scale Keyboard (a versatile scaled keyboard)\n- Expressive Keyboard (a MIDI-MPE keyboard for expressive performances)\n- Remote (remotely triggers multiple notes and visual effects at once)\n- Pads (a 4x4 pads grid)\n- Cube Mixer (a 3D mixing space)\n- Cylinder Mixer (a cylindrical 3D mixing space)\n- Knobs (4 configurable knobs)\n- Sliders (4 configurable sliders)\n- FX (visual effects)\n\nDownload Modulia Desktop for MacOS and Windows to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software: www.modulia-studio.com/get-modulia-studio/#desktop \n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAbleton\u00ae and Live\u2122 are trademarks of Ableton AG.", "short_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt lets you wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has a deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session\n- Circular Keyboard\n- Scale Keyboard\n- Expressive Keyboard\n- Remote\n- Pads\n- Cube Mixer\n- Cylinder Mixer\n- Knobs\n- Sliders\n- FX\n\nGet Modulia Desktop to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software at www.modulia-studio.com "}]}, "developer_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "support_website_url": 